                        Developer Blueprint
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">How to Add New Pages & Options in 3 Steps</h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">This application uses the shared <code class="text-indigo-300 font-mono">&lt;x-app-layout&gt;</code> component. You can create custom pages in seconds:</p>
                </div>
